6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Nice one, Tanaka!

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
What was that?!

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
You're in the way, and our back players can't move up.

9
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Huh?

10
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:56,000
You're in the way, and our back players can't move up.

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
What? Is... is that actually true?

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Not sure. Everybody was so scattered on that play, I really couldn't tell you.

13
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Oh, okay!

14
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
I totally did not notice that! Wow!

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Kageyama saw it during the play, and Nichinoya knew exactly what he was talking about once it was pointed out.

16
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:36,000
What impresses me is he thinks he can talk to Nichinoya like that!

17
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Still, you didn't have to say it the way you did!

18
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Alright, why don't you tell me how I should have said it?

19
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,000
What the hell did you just say to me?!

20
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Alright! I'm gonna go ahead and stop you right there.

21
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Sorry about that.

22
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:02,000
I mean, complaining about Nichinoya is one thing, but complaining about him in the middle of a game like that has gotta be a first.

23
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Well, that's Kageyama for you.

24
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:09,000
I don't know why, but somehow he seems...

25
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,000
...scarier than usual.

26
